# hide_clients of a monitor counts every minimized client, another monitor's too, once it is arranged.
monitors 2
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-1
open a
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-2
open n
get monitor HEADLESS-1
dispatch @n minimized
get monitor HEADLESS-1
get monitor HEADLESS-2
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-1
open b
get monitor HEADLESS-1
get monitor HEADLESS-2
